Instalation manual http://www.us.debian.org/releases/stable/alpha/ch05s01.html.en
Suggests: boot xxxx -flags 0 (where xxxx is the CDROM)

http://www.debian.org/releases/slink/alpha/ch-rescue-boot.en.html
