>I would like to know which video card is supported for a DEC Alpha by De=
bian Linux without having to modify the kernel?  I am sure that someone i=
s out there who is actually running a system like mine with a working vid=
eo card?  I would like to know the make and model of the card that you ar=
e using and the extent to which it works.
